OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy or
OL,6,Fbright during this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with occasional clear
OL,8,Fspells. Mainly dry, although the odd
OL,9,Fshower is possible. Winds turning into
OL,10,Fthe west, light to moderate.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,13,Fa scattering of showers. The showers
OL,14,Flikely becoming heavy, thundery and
OL,15,Fturning into a longer spell of rain in
OL,16,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
